Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.39,0:00:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,電視裡不斷重複著 相同的影像
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:11.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在無法與新拜科努爾基地取得聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.33,0:00:13.14,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,特布爾發生升空事故
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.41,0:00:15.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事故起因等詳細情報尚未流出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.93,0:00:18.56,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,TASA 新型火箭升空失敗
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事故發生半日後 庫特的母親仍然生死不明
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.82,0:02:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,衛星拍攝的影像顯示
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.68,0:02:07.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整個新拜科努爾基地都受到爆炸影響
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.02,0:02:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在被大規模火災包圍
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.90,0:02:17.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外 由於裝載在火箭上的實驗爐也可能發生了爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,產生化學災害的可能性也受到矚目…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.50,0:02:22.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情況還在惡化…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.27,0:02:25.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且倖存者的情報也完全看不到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 不只是火箭的爆炸嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.25,0:02:32.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼…會發生這種事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:37.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼…盡發生這種我們束手無策的事呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.10,0:02:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事都可能發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:45.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生之前誰都不會想到它會發生
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生了的事註定是會發生的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.74,0:02:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重要的是 不被悲劇打敗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.40,0:02:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信自己總有一天能忘卻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特萊卡!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫醬!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫醬…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:09.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.44,0:03:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:18.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…被關在監牢裡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.55,0:03:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,監牢?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.31,0:03:21.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別激動 庫特萊卡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事的 庫醬
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.86,0:03:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們陪著你
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那天深夜 庫特回到了宿舍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,次日 庫特請假了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.94,0:03:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們除了擔心 什麼都沒能做到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.46,0:04:03.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.60,0:04:07.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,裝載在火箭上的實驗爐爆炸的可能性似乎變高了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.54,0:04:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為防污染擴散 今後特布爾的出入境恐會受限
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解釋一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:19.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思就是特布爾現在很危險
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.13,0:04:23.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以入境出境都變困難了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.40,0:04:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火箭的乘務員的平安情報還是沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.95,0:04:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫醬 肯定擔心得坐立難安了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.73,0:04:38.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定恨不得飛回去見媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:41.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是特布爾現在禁止入境啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.54,0:04:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特布爾大使館給庫特萊卡寄來了機票
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.51,0:04:53.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在特布爾 她母親似乎是個有名的英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.42,0:04:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是英雄的女兒才被特例允許跨海入境
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.25,0:05:00.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對方貌似是要讓她去確認母親的平安
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.11,0:05:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使館的人似乎明天就會來接她
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那庫特就是要回特布爾了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.57,0:05:12.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在不是很危險嗎 去了也許就回不來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.60,0:05:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是庫醬肯定很想見媽媽…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.82,0:05:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她媽媽肯定也平平安安地等著見女兒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.98,0:05:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬也這麼想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.55,0:05:28.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.17,0:05:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是 或許她媽媽已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.02,0:05:40.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回去了 肯定只會…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.29,0:05:42.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,受傷害!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:53.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:54.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:57.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不回去也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:06:00.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會讓人悲傷恐懼的場面 不看也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.69,0:06:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.58,0:06:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.06,0:06:18.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 Good afternoon…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.93,0:06:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不是 嗯…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.61,0:06:22.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特 你不用掛慮我們的感受的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:28.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我讓大家操心了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.11,0:06:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起我們 現在更重要的是你和你媽媽的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.01,0:06:38.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們聽說了 你收到機票了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:41.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特要回特布爾嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,該怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.22,0:06:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想見媽媽 可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.60,0:06:55.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回不了特布爾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.50,0:07:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我是逃來這裡…逃來日本的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃回來的?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.21,0:07:08.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們願意聽嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨笨的我的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.56,0:07:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從小就敬仰媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.83,0:07:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我沒敢告訴任何人 不過成為宇航員一直是我的夢想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫萊 你剛才說什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.40,0:07:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想當宇航員?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:40.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:43.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然願意以宇航員為目標努力
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.62,0:07:47.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 今天太高興了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.13,0:07:50.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特萊卡!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.37,0:07:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特萊卡 能為你起這個名字我很驕傲
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.99,0:07:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一隻衝出宇宙的萊卡犬
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.58,0:08:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渺小的生命為人類的未來點燃了偉大的希望
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特萊卡成了驅動世界的重要齒輪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.26,0:08:13.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要人如其名 成為世界的齒輪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.45,0:08:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能驅動世界的齒輪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.20,0:08:24.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這樣我於一年前就讀了特布爾的航空學院
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航空學院?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.55,0:08:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是培養當宇航員的高等專門機關
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.91,0:08:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我為實現夢想拚命學習
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:39.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是現實往往沒有自己想的那麼順利
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上了宇宙必須要會說英語和俄語
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.01,0:08:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且課程是全英文的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.47,0:08:48.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完全跟不上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.92,0:08:54.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,努力就會得到回報什麼的根本是亂扯
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.55,0:09:02.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「媽媽才華橫溢 女兒平庸至極 簡直浪費國家經費」
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我經常被人如此嘲諷
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.50,0:09:07.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任誰都會覺得我很滑稽
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.73,0:09:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再怎麼努力也只有這種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.45,0:09:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎您!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我甚至開始覺得自己不是媽媽的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最終我只在學校待了半年
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:37.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對媽媽一聲不響地逃來了日本
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:42.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果在這裡我還是半吊子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.62,0:09:45.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搖擺不定 一無是處
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.04,0:09:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒能力為世界做貢獻的劣質齒輪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:58.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽對如此軟弱的我到底有多失望呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.27,0:10:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我回不了特布爾
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.58,0:10:08.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特的軟弱不是所有人都有的那種軟弱嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.27,0:10:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴一直垂著頭 彷彿庫特口中說的是自己一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.44,0:10:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特公在猶豫嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.00,0:10:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼做好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.79,0:10:27.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真人怎麼看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:30.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼複雜的問題我怎麼懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.11,0:10:33.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 你幫我想吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能冷靜思考是你的特長吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:45.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我其實…覺得庫特還是回去的好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.72,0:10:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也擔心她媽媽 不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:52.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在庫特還沒調整好心態…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:59.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在沒選擇回去 能美女史一定會後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:03.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可能再也見不到母親了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.74,0:11:09.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特萊卡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:13.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,與其選擇不去憑空後悔
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如選擇回去後悔個夠
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.90,0:11:20.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不向前進就不會有任何收穫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.37,0:11:22.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.01,0:11:25.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我明白的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.15,0:11:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白我必須去 那個…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.53,0:11:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是…我好怕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想留下來 留在大家身邊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.70,0:11:39.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我給大使館打電話 機票也還回去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.81,0:11:50.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是庫特的選擇 我們沒權利插嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:12:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…一直在逃避
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.25,0:12:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛不起來 走不過去的庫特萊卡
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:20.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來 你都想起來了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.77,0:12:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:29.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要重度相同的時間和經歷嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.13,0:12:32.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的願望改變了?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:33.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.19,0:12:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不論你如何選擇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 還有我們都不會責備你
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.65,0:12:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起 恭介學長!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.93,0:12:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭介估計認為庫特應該回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告訴她要直面痛苦很簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.76,0:12:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是說的話誰都能辦到
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我還沒堅強到能對她說出「要面對現實」這種話
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼選擇 都會留下悔恨
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.94,0:13:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這個問題根本不存在正解
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直枝君
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杉並同學?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.47,0:13:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不舒服?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.38,0:13:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.90,0:13:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.37,0:13:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了 修學旅行的日子就快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.55,0:13:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜現在實在沒那個心情
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三枝同學肯定也是如此吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.18,0:13:49.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在活動室嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.48,0:14:04.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才的是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 你肌肉不夠哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 怎麼啦 理樹
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.81,0:14:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杵在那幹啥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.69,0:14:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這箱子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:22.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 這個也要啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要燒掉?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 這是值日生的職責嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.74,0:14:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 先別燒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.79,0:14:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不確認下裡面沒關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.98,0:14:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是是不燃物就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.67,0:14:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也對哈 還可能是食物來著
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.25,0:14:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:44.01,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,好帥啊 不過看來沒什麼實用
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.82,0:14:41.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全是在庫特的房間裡看到過的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是庫特扔的嗎 這些
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:45.52,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,又不能吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.33,0:14:49.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這啥
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.49,0:14:50.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是某種零配件嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狗牌…是身份識別牌
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:59.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(321,435)\fs21}Dog Tag
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,俄語?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.43,0:15:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫公要燒這麼重要的東西?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.01,0:15:08.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這箱子讓我保管一會兒行嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.66,0:15:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙開發史…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二戰後 發射成功第一顆人工衛星的是蘇聯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.54,0:15:22.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搭乘伴侶號上了宇宙的狗有13條
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.80,0:15:30.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.11,0:15:32.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chernushka
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.74,0:15:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻成英文就是Blackie
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.85,0:15:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特的媽媽是黑髮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是她媽媽的身份識別牌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.63,0:15:46.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宇宙工學概論
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.47,0:15:47.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,德維特和埃弗萊特
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.37,0:15:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聖埃克絮佩裡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.80,0:15:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,星之王子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.23,0:15:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這箱子裝滿了庫特的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:16:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我試證了一下天為什麼是藍的 太興奮了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.76,0:16:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果埃弗萊特的平行宇宙論是正確的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.83,0:16:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼這個世界上就存在無數組南十字星
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:13.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美妙到讓我無法呼吸了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:20.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚我寫了一篇關於黑洞和相對論的小論文
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很難為情 我不會告訴任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.11,0:16:25.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:34.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜你入學 庫萊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.34,0:16:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.15,0:16:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是我進入宇航局後一直穿戴著的披風和帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望它們能代替我一直守護著你
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.96,0:16:52.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.95,0:17:02.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這帽子和披風原來是你媽媽的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.37,0:17:06.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要扔掉嗎 這一箱的寶物
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.32,0:17:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我夢想的殘骸
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.17,0:17:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是悔恨的化身
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:17.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經沒資格擁有它們了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.04,0:17:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本 當不成宇航員
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.55,0:17:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在撒謊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.92,0:17:30.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論怎麼逃避 你都肯定沒辦法抹掉真正的心願
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.52,0:17:33.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的…心願?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.27,0:17:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特你啊 從心底嚮往著宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.36,0:17:45.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,達不到媽媽的水平也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稚嫩也好 笨拙也罷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特只要尋找自己能做的事就好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特只要成為獨樹一幟的齒輪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:17:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永不言棄地追自己的宇宙夢就好
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個夢 是你敬仰的媽媽教給你的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.80,0:18:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特想見媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.32,0:18:29.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能逃避這個想法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.93,0:18:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算再軟弱 就算挨批評 有什麼關係呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.85,0:18:36.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畢竟庫特最喜歡媽媽了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.53,0:18:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.99,0:18:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再逃避了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我想去…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.63,0:18:51.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,見媽媽 去見媽媽!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:18:54.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.22,0:18:56.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去見她
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.30,0:19:02.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我大概 是在對自己說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:05.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「不能逃避」
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.20,0:19:12.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你理樹 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.71,0:19:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,機票拿好了?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.23,0:19:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.95,0:19:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上小心
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.26,0:19:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.47,0:19:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒了你會冷清不少
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.72,0:19:41.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特萊爾加 貝爾加
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.04,0:19:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能拜託你照顧斯特萊爾加和貝爾加嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.70,0:19:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 好
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:55.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.38,0:19:57.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.55,0:19:59.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要聽鈴的話哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.54,0:20:01.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.04,0:20:05.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大使館的人告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.80,0:20:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能我再也回不了日本了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.70,0:20:15.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能回來的 肯定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們說好了 一定
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:18.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要回來
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.79,0:20:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們永遠等著你
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:21.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.64,0:20:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到這裡是能美的…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:27.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有能美能完成的任務
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.79,0:20:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在媽媽面前我總是喜歡逞強 沒讓她認識到真正的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.25,0:20:46.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走到哪裡都因為言行奇怪被人嘲笑
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.87,0:20:48.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以一直孤身一人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.14,0:20:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過現在我有了你們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.90,0:20:55.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們接受了原本的我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.27,0:20:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.81,0:20:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會回來的!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.18,0:21:00.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.23,0:21:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會回來的!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請對我說「祝你好運」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.30,0:21:20.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(480,432)\fs21}Ни пуха,ни пера
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.65,0:21:22.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是祝對方好運的小咒語
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.64,0:21:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祝你…好運
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:32.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.60,0:21:35.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜 庫醬
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:36.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們等你 能美
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.93,0:21:44.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs21}Прощайте
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.23,0:21:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特孤身一人 朝著阻擋在前的困難
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.30,0:21:54.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第22話\N我…一定回來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第22話\N我…一定回來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.79,0:22:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第22話\N我…一定回來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.05,0:23:29.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特布爾的狀況超出預料
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.29,0:23:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,殘酷的試煉向回國的庫特襲來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.90,0:23:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們難道只能祈禱她的平安嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.67,0:23:39.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,庫特有生命危險!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.00,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}ひとりが辛いから
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.09,0:01:02.16,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}ふたつの手をつないだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:08.74,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}ふたりじゃ寂しいから輪になって手をつないだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:16.79,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}きっとそれが幾千の力にもなり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:21.95,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}どんな夢も断てる気がするんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:25.63,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}高く飛べ　高く空へ　高く蹴れ
